  "unresolved": "Core two-shock SEPARATION remains INFEASIBLE with free data (N=2 events). To answer it properly requires paid intraday Treasury-futures/SOFR tick history (>=1.5-4 yr of complete intraday coverage per Part1 power calc). Options-implied skew/tail outcomes are also out of scope (no free intraday IV surface). Codex primary-path review + worktree merge are handled by the followup fire (per brief)."
